&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend the druid query engine and storage system to support a wider class of query functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build complex query capabilities with the best query performance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the field engineering team so they can offer the best support to our customers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help in the growth of Apache Druid community through code and design reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
