&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing high concurrency, performance-oriented Java systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years of experience working as an Individual contributor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grasp on good software engineering practices such as code reviews and deep focus on testability and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills: ability to explain complex technical concepts to designers, support staff, and other engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in computer science, engineering, or a related field (or equivalent experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
